            <title xml:id="title_00f00d18" xml:lang="da">Symfoni nr. 2 i E-dur</title>
            <title xml:id="title_06103098" xml:lang="en">Symphony No. 2 in E Major</title>
            <title xml:id="title_fd0e28d5" xml:lang="de">Symphonie Nr. 2 in E-Dur</title>
            <contributor xml:id="respStmt_N2047F">
               <persName role="composer" xml:id="persName_19a972df">J.P.E. Hartmann</persName>
            </contributor>
            <creation xml:id="creation_fef55ab8">
               <date enddate="1848-08-31" startdate="1847-06-07" xml:id="date_N20488">7 June 1847 to 31 Aug. 1848</date>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_e3d48031">
               <p xml:id="idm172">Hartmann worked on his second symphony from the early summer of 1847, when he began with the second movement, to the end of August 1848. At that time Musikforeningen had discontinued its concert activities because of the war with Germany and it was therefore not performed until 14 March 1849. When the symphony had its second performance in 1875, it was revised by Axel Liebmann. Hartmann thought highly of him, but it is not known for sure whether he accepted Liebmann's changes.</p>
            </history>
