               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_N202E3">In stiff, brown binding; label glued to the back of the binding, much worn and illegible. Slightly trimmed before binding. On p. 1 (beginning of first movement) "Simphonie N<rend xml:id="idm34" rend="sup">o</rend> 2: 6/6 47". Written in brown ink with numerous corrections, additions and indication of possible omissions in pencil, and red and blue crayon by Axel Liebmann (some of them specified in the parts). Paper: pp. 1-41 (first movement, bb. 1-177) : 18 staves, pp. 42-91 (first movement, bb. 178-380): 14 staves. pp. 92-255 (second, third and fourth movements): 20 staves. Date on page 91 (last page of first movement): "d. 8. Januar 1848". Date on page 254 (last page of fourth movement): "J.P.E. Hartmann D. 31<rend xml:id="idm35" rend="sup">te</rend> August 1848 Op. 48". Paginated in pencil pp. 1-210 then in the same ink as the music.</physMedium>
