         <manifestation label="" xml:id="source_d1e142">
            <titleStmt xml:id="titleStmt_N203A6">
               <title xml:id="title_0d734079">Parts, manuscript copies</title>
            </titleStmt>
            <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_N203AC">
               <extent xml:id="extent_N203AD">30 parts</extent>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_N203B2">All parts except extra string parts and tb. bound in grey boards; some of the extra string parts unbound. The parts (except for tb., copied by Axel Liebmann and added in connection with the revision) were used both for the first performance in 1849 and for the revised version in 1875; however, Axel Liebmann's changes in the score and the corresponding details in the parts are not identical. Numerous corrections and cuts in pencil and blue and red crayon. Corrections glued into certain passages in the first and fourth movement. Loosely inserted music sheet in each part with Liebmann's alternative version of the end of the first movement. Only the added tuba part has this alternative ending written directly into the part. Many of the loose insertions are folded in a way that indicates that at some point - probably after 1920 - they ceased to be used and Hartmann's original version was used instead.</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
            <notesStmt xml:id="notesStmt_N203B4">
               <annot type="source_description" xml:id="annot_bea8a740">
                  <p xml:id="idm107">Parts: vl.1 (4); vl.2 (3); va. (2); cb. (4); fl.1; fl.2; ob.1; ob.2; cl.1; cl.2; fg.1; fg.2; cor.1; cor.2; tr.1; tr.2; cnt.1; cnt.2; trb.1; trb.2; tb.; timp. </p>
               </annot>
            </notesStmt>
